// Special payloads judged by Dash Core: what decoderawtransaction prints for
// crafted transactions on regtest dashds of v23.1.8 and v24.0.0-rc.3 (release
// binaries, SHA256SUMS checked), each under the basic flag (V19 active at
// height 1) and the legacy flag (-testactivationheight=v19@1000), with one
// block mined so the flag is set from V19. Core prints
// a payload object only when GetTxPayload succeeds, so null is its decode
// failure. Inputs: contrib/vectors/payloads/gen.py (BLS samples from the
// BS11a-t wrapper corpus); every outcome comes from Core. Regenerate with:
//   gen.py probe --release v23.1.8=<dir> --release v24.0.0-rc.3=<dir> \
//     --work <dir> --header <this comment> \
//     --out pkgs/primitives/corpus/payload_core.json5
